 shoot because we had no  idea where anything was and this space  is basically allowing us to  be way more efficient and be way more  organized and work with a lot more  people on our shoots finally more than  anything else since we've been working  on bigger and bigger projects over the  last few years we realized if we want to  be treated as professionals we kind of  have to  look and kind of organize ourselves like  professionals so just look and organize  though nothing  yeah it's just it's kind of a con it's a  facade how do we use this for shoots  what does it look like when we're gonna  like prepare for a shoot and like what  is all this space for well come and  check it out  one of the first rooms we go to when  we're having a shoot is our new and  improved prop room way more space for  all this junk we've been collecting over  the years such as jake's fake hand  the pulse rifle from our gravity gun and  all of  freaking links arrows and swords and  stuff but basically  we keep almost  essentially all our stuff in here now  all our props we got everything from our  crazy tether helmets here we have our  mustache and wig bin everything's  actually on the beat bad guy helmet it's  a really really really great spot for  just kind of picking and choosing  everything and we've been collecting so  much junk over the years where it's kind  of like we don't need to get any other  stuff because if you want to sort you  got a sword if you want a gun you got a  gun and if you want a boot  get a boot  and we have so many cool things in here  everything everything from  pack vests to  freaking  there's so much crap in here elk antlers  in front of our pizza signs  yep that's a prop room so once we get  our actors all dressed up we come out  here a little bit and we say actors  which gun do you want to shoot today you  want to shoot this laser pistol with a  crazy sight or do you want to shoot a  normal old-fashioned like assault rifle  or a freaking hunting rifle or a  a